# 2. TECHNOLOGY AND ARCHITECTURE

Use native Android development.

Preferred technologies:

- Kotlin
- Jetpack Compose
- Material 3
- MVVM architecture
- Clean Architecture principles
- Room Database
- DataStore Preferences
